# NATURE is gone, the tracks are PIANO KEYS PAD BASS LEAD DRUMKIT: an older project (... DRUMS NATURE) opens with the
# drums as track 6 (their notes with them) and a LEAD as track 5 (the world's drones gone)
wait 300
trkset 5 5 0 0
trkset 6 6 0 0
seed 0 5 3 0
seed 0 6 4 0
expect eventsA5 3
expect eventsA6 4
roundtrip
wait 100
expect eventsA5 0
expect eventsA6 3
tap HOME
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect track 4
expect eng 11
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect track 5
expect eng 5
# the demo itself: track 5 a LEAD, track 6 the drums
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w5
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 100
expect track 4
expect eng 11
tapkey w5
wait 100
expect track 5
expect eng 5
